{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406390/extras/tropical_dreams_1.gif?t=1741803633\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Add the tropics to your life! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Plant Therapy Tropical Dreams DLC celebrates all things tropical, with a focus on new plants, adding 64 new items to the cozy plant collecting game Plant Therapy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406390/extras/tropical_dreams_2.gif?t=1741803633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes:<br>20 new tropical plants, including orchids, a coffee plant, a goldfish plant and a new giant Monstera. Some bloom and some grow from sprouts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406390/extras/tropical_dreams_items_1.png?t=1741803633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New furniture: Rattan sofa, sisal rugs, lava lights, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New art: Bright and beautiful wallpapers, gallery art, and decorative pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New pots with a focus on large and XL pots for those new lush plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And introducing: FROGBOT! A new bot to collect your coins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406390/extras/tropical_dreams_items_3.png?t=1741803633\" /> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3406390?t=1741803633","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3406390?t=1741803633","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406390/b4bc980b6bdd10f584aafec8310c7be9a4637b4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741803633","capsule_imagev5":"http